Cost-optimisation consumers missing from llm-cost-optimizations.patch.

Adds:
  - bool KIND_RULES entry so the ad-detection settings form saves without 500
  - OpenRouter provider routing via OPENROUTER_PROVIDER_SORT/ORDER env vars
  - Prompt-caching cache_control annotation on system messages
  - skip_verification_under_seconds enforcement in processing.py

